# Known Issues

This file tracks known bugs, limitations, and deferred work items for the project.

## How to Use

- **Before working on a component**: Check this file for known problems
  that may affect your work or that your work could address.
- **When discovering a new issue**: Add an entry with status, date, component,
  problem description, and any known root cause or workaround.
- **When resolving an issue**: Update the status to "Resolved" with the date and
  a brief note on the fix, but keep the entry for historical context.

