    worst: `K` +0.62, `D` +0.66, `makayla1` +0.52. v7 matches v4
    exactly on the two previously-strong PDFs (`generic3=0.6634`,
    `Electrical_Takeoff_page7=1.00`).
  - **Training dynamics**: in-loop `eval_map_50` rose monotonically
    from 0.2073 (epoch 1) to peak 0.2555 (epoch 9, selected as best
    checkpoint), then plateaued at ~0.25 through epoch 15. Compare to
    v6's 0.0005-0.001 across its entire 30-epoch run. v7's gradient
    norms stayed in the 15-80 range with occasional spikes -- normal
    for fine-tuning under `max_grad_norm=0.1`.
  - **Training recipe** (single-variable change vs v4 -- only the
    dataset is new):
    ```
    --data ~/Documents/TableAnnotations/v6
    --output ~/Documents/TableAnnotations/models_v7
    --epochs 15
    --batch-size 2
    --learning-rate 1e-5
    --warmup-steps 50
    --weight-decay 0.01
    --val-split 0.1
    --num-queries 15
    --freeze-backbone-epochs 0
    ```
    All other defaults match v4 (linear LR scheduler,
